msgstr "Rilancia la scansione, o ne esporta il risultato."

#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/guide/content/divers.py:25
#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/guide/content/logs.py:445
#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/guide/content/securite_active.py:222
